 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Mikage-kun wa Oshi ga Tsuyoi"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "御影くんは推しがつよい"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Matsumoto Hina, a loner and otaku, has only one daily pleasure: watching the streams of Vtuber Yoh Amami. On her first day at the new school, she is seated next to Toma Mikage, who is feared for suddenly causing an assault at the entrance ceremony. The love story between a girl who is into her favorite idol and a yakuza boy who is hiding a big secret is about to begin.\n\n(Source: Comic Days, translated)",
   "ja": "ぼっちでオタクな松本陽菜は、Vtuber天海ヨウ様の配信を観ることだけが日々の楽しみ。転校初日、隣の席になったのは、入学式でいきなり傷害事件を起こして恐れられる御影斗真だった。推し活女子と大いなる秘密を抱えた極道男子の恋が今、動き出す──。"
  },
